OL,3,GNEWSAShootings down more than 77% in
OL,4,AGreater Manchester
OL,5,
OL,6,FShootings in Greater Manchester have
OL,7,Ffallen by more than three quarters in
OL,8,Fthe past five years, police figures
OL,9,Fshow.
OL,11,FAccording to GMP figures, there were 16
OL,12,Ffirearms discharges in the 12 months to
OL,13,FApril 2026, down from 71 in 2020-21, a
OL,14,Ffall of 77.5% over five years.
OL,16,FThe force has also recovered more than
OL,17,F420 viable weapons since April 2021. It
OL,18,Fcomes as Greater Manchester marks
OL,19,Fthree-and-a-half years without a fatal
OL,20,Fshooting in the region.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
