OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAShootings down more than 77% in
OL,4,AGreater Manchester
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Supt Joe Harrop, head of serious
OL,7,Fand organised crime at GMP, said
OL,8,Fretaliatory shootings between rival
OL,9,Fgroups had become less common because
OL,10,Fof the force's "robust police
OL,11,Fresponse".
